ph to change concavity, the value of the second derivative ${h}^{″}(x)$ must switch signs. So, we are looking for points where the graph of ${h}^{″}(x)$ crosses the $x$-axis.\n\nWe can see that the graph $y={h}^{″}(x)$ crosses the $x$-axis at $x=-3.$ \n\nTherefore, $h(x)$ has points of inflection at $x=-3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-31224/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "977a9b6e-744a-554b-92ee-0b6343041ecf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-31224"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-79200/selection/a2d479d8fb62f97e597a263fd2458ca389ec840ad9515a57890c07f9a1eb6794" :answer/id #uuid "13fb1a98-3b74-5fc9-94b5-677f6f9553db" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-3,$ $x=0,$ and $x=4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79200/selection/3156fa3aa006e591d496860456be38662b872375433bbcf5b2f4cb01e08eaa8b" :answer/id #uuid "0dc8b157-7c31-5520-86d5-398490e4cf98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79200/selection/cb1896197a67f182a612a87dbfdf77a8994e499a7df0036f929b0112dee816e0" :answer/id #uuid "48c2fa81-7f35-5e0a-955d-625d74477f8e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79200/selection/8e4d4a3b045de0431ac85bcd6cc7267a709c597f961b6ccc66ccc78e25a8d60e" :answer/id #uuid "62d0cf2f-a834-5fcc-ac44-2090d7ab89f0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-3$ and $x=4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79200/selection/6bac05a62229f29eba4498544257eb386a58da0ea736d3d95ca346c883c43950" :answer/id #uuid "c2b09eeb-837b-5d5d-8fc4-0f380227af07" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79200/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c7a6ffea-ff76-537a-8399-e287f6d1cecc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-79200/selection/8e4d4a3b045de0